Dear Karen

 

I attach a list of what I have identified as corrections / errors.

 

I do so, mindful as I am of my obligation to try and help the Court and his Lordship, and because I received your email inviting me to assist.

 

I must however add that I am not instructed by Mrs. Zahmoul and she will almost certainly have her own list of corrections / errors /  material omissions that she will wish to provide to you.  Please do not treat the attached document as a substitution or replacement for anything which Mrs. Zahmoul, acting in person, may wish the judge to consider. That is not the purpose or intent of the document which I am attaching. It is simply an attempt to help. 

 

With best wishes

 

Brent Molyneux


Brent Molyneux KC - Barrister 

Chambers of Alexis Campbell KC and Nicholas Allen KC 

A 29 Bedford Row, London WC1R 4HE DX LDE 1044 
